{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible; approach it. If approachable; grab it and check its properties. Finally, take it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    />\"",
